<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DAYTON HUDSON STARTED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DAYTON HUDSON STARTED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown Brothers said analyst Joseph Ronning started coverage of Dayton Hudson Corp with a near-term hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Long-term rating is market perform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1/16 to 62-3/8.</p>
